#### 4.3.1 Factor Attention Top-K (ids)

- 2020-07-01: top10 ids=[38, 9, 63, 53, 0, 23, 18, 83, 62, 2]
- 2021-02-09: top10 ids=[38, 9, 63, 39, 25, 0, 18, 53, 58, 26]
- 2021-09-28: top10 ids=[38, 9, 25, 26, 4, 39, 23, 41, 121, 63]
